  "text": "### 8. Reporting to Regulators  \n**FCA/PRA Correspondence:**\n- Risk Committee Chair may meet with regulators directly\n- Committee updates sent to regulators (annually or as requested)\n- Regulatory concerns/orders escalated immediately\n- Regulatory feedback discussed in committee  \n**Regulatory Requirements:**\n- Committee composition meets regulatory standards\n- Meeting frequency meets regulatory expectations\n- Risk oversight sufficiently detailed per regulations\n- Documentation complete and retained",
